  "prefLabel": "Pes 305.03 Minimum Age for Private Applicator Permits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 305.03 Minimum Age for Private Applicator Permits. Applications for private applicator general use and restricted use permits issued pursuant to this chapter shall be accepted only from those individuals who have attained the age of 18.\n\nSource. #4812, eff 5-3-90; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96; ss by #8059, eff 5-30-04; ss by #10198-B, eff 10-3-12; ss by #13363, eff 6-1-22, EXPIRES: 6-1-32",
